      "tag": "Crypto",
      "title": "Bitcoin taps $85,000 for first time since January as short liquidations surge",
      "summary": "BTC briefly cleared $85,000 Monday, highest since January, up more than 5% in 24 hours from the ~$81k area. CoinGlass showed $650M\u2013$750M in crypto liquidations over 24 hours, mostly shorts, including ~$262M in one hour near $84k. Open interest still rose, so traders chased. First weekly close above the 50-week MA in 45 weeks. Listed catch is IBIT 0DTE; MSTR/COIN next options Friday."
