      "summary": "ES/NQ higher on an AI bid after last week's sector scare faded. Intel, Marvell, Meta, Dell pointed higher premarket. A ~2% oil drop pulled yields lower. Trump said he would be open to meeting Iran's president at UNGA. Greenland security deal with Denmark also helped sentiment."
    },
